OL,3,GNEWSAFourth warmest September on record
OL,4,Afor Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island also experienced half the
OL,7,Famount of rainfall it usually does for
OL,8,FSeptember with a total of 29.6mm of
OL,9,Frain - well below the long-term average
OL,10,Fof 59.7mm.
